# Guardrails - HITSHCM

## Secrets

- Never commit `.env`, `.mcp.json` with real keys, service-role keys, or tokens.
- Never edit `.env` in-repo; change only `.env.example` names.
- Never put privileged secrets in `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` (or client-exposed equivalents).
- Do not paste live secrets into chat.

## Scope

- One TASK at a time. No hitchhiking features.
- If asked work conflicts with PRD Out / TASKS, stop and ask.
- Do not add dependencies without explicit approval.

## Evidence before done

- Do not claim done without tests, commands, or explicit manual checks.
- Prefer `/vibe-verify` or the verifier agent after implementer.
- Append `GOTCHAS.md` after bugfixes; append `DECISIONS.md` for architecture choices.
